Text: Based on this, we re-purpose a multi-domain summariza- tion dataset MULTI-SUM and further explore the issue of domain shift. Methodologically, we employ four types of mod- els with their characteristics under different set- tings. The ﬁrst model is inspired by the joint train- ing strategy, and the second one builds the connec- tion between large-scale pre-trained models and multi-domain learning.

