Section: 2.2 Publications as Domain
Text: We call this re-purposed subset of Newsroom MULTI-SUM to indicate it is specially designed for multi-domain learning in summarization tasks. From Table 1, we can ﬁnd that data from those news publications vary in indicators that are closely relevant to summarization. This means that (docu- ment, summary) pairs from different publications will have unique summarization formation, and models might need to learn different semantic fea- tures for different publications.

