Section: 1 Introduction
Text: We then re- purpose a dataset MULTI-SUM to provide a sufﬁcient multi-domain testbed (IN-DOMAIN and OUT-OF-DOMAIN). • To the best of our knowledge, this is the ﬁrst work that introduces domain shift to text sum- marization. We also demonstrate how domain shift affects the current system by designing a veriﬁcation experiment.

