Section: 2.2 Publications as Domain
Text: A simple classiﬁcation model with GloVe initializ- ing words can also achieve 74.84% accuracy (the chance is 20%), which ensures us that there is a built-in bias in each publication. Therefore, it is reasonable to view one publication as a domain and use our multi-publication MULTI-SUM as a multi-domain dataset.

Rank: 8
